.spec/ssh-transport-conformance-contract.md:38:| Client-initiated rekey | Byte-threshold, time-threshold, test, and manual triggers use the production KEX path under active traffic. Rekey failure/timeout stays connection-fatal. |
.spec/ssh-transport-conformance-contract.md:39:| Server-initiated rekey handling | Inbound server KEX remains protocol-correct under active traffic without loss, duplication, reordering, or unbounded buffering. Exact reason/lifecycle/generation reporting is the M3 semantic below. |
