   226	
   227	Backoff is bounded, jittered, and reset after a stable connection. Authentication
   228	and host-key mismatch do not retry indefinitely. Path-unavailable and transient
   229	connect failures may retry while the system expects VPN continuity. A user stop
   230	cancels all retries promptly and waits for descriptor/task cleanup before
   231	reporting disconnected.
